  "description": "The FavoriteBikes Hybrid CSC is a step-through commuter e-bike that arrives loaded with the everyday essentials many riders otherwise buy separately. Aluminum fenders, a rear rack with an integrated brake light, a pannier bag, a smart headlight, and a motorized lock all come included, so it is a genuinely complete Costco e-bike whether you buy this electric bike at Costco or order it directly from FavoriteBikes.\nShopping for an e-bike at Costco? The Hybrid CSC keeps daily riding simple. A smooth Shimano CUES 9-speed drivetrain handles hills and stop-and-go traffic, while a 48V / 500W hub motor delivers up to 60Nm of torque for confident starts and everyday climbs. A removable 48V battery supports up to 96 km (60 miles) per charge, with real-world range varying by rider weight, terrain, assist level, and weather.\nSafety is built in, with hydraulic disc brakes, an LG color display, and UL 2849 and UL 2271 certification for the electrical system and battery. The motorized lock keeps the motor disabled while it is engaged, adding peace of mind at the bike rack.\nFinal assembly uses the included tools and step-by-step guide; add your own helmet and any locally required safety gear, charge the battery, and you are set for your first ride. You can buy this Hybrid CSC electric bike at Costco Canada or order it directly from FavoriteBikes on this page. Among electric bikes at Costco, it comes genuinely complete rather than needing extra add-ons.\nIf you buy through Costco instead, its current pricing, delivery, and return terms apply. Every new FavoriteBikes e-bike includes a 2-year comprehensive warranty on the bike, battery, and electrical components, with an optional 6 additional months when you register. FavoriteBikes stands behind this Costco electric bike with manuals, app support, and replacement parts — text +1 (256) 291-1260 or email support@favoritebikes.com.",
